// Auto-generated for the Unit Board — Level 3 (2001–3000字) Unit 20
window.T20_DASHBOARD_UNITS = [{"unit":1,"theme":"admire – drain","cards":[{"w":"admire","p":"v.","d":"to regard with respect, wonder, or warm approval","c":"欽佩；欣賞；讚賞","s":"I truly admire our class leader because she always remains calm and solves difficult problems efficiently.","t":"我真的很欽佩我們的班長，因為她總是保持冷靜並高效率地解決棘手問題。"},{"w":"admiration","p":"n.","d":"a feeling of profound respect and approval","c":"欽佩；讚賞（不可數）","s":"The young tennis player looked at the world champion in deep admiration during the ceremony.","t":"典禮期間，那位年輕網球選手深深欽佩地注視著世界冠軍。"},{"w":"admirable","p":"adj.","d":"deserving respect, praise, or admiration","c":"令人欽佩的；極佳的","s":"The dedicated doctor showed admirable patience while treating dozens of injured patients all through the night.","t":"這位敬業的醫生整夜治療數十名受傷病患時，展現了令人欽佩的耐心。"},{"w":"airline","p":"n.","d":"an organization that provides a regular public air transport service","c":"航空公司（可數）","s":"The major commercial airline announced that several international flights would be delayed due to the heavy blizzard.","t":"這家大型商業航空公司宣布，由於強烈暴風雪，數個國際航班將會延誤。"},{"w":"automobile","p":"n.","d":"a road vehicle designed primarily for passengers; a car","c":"汽車（可數）","s":"Thousands of enthusiastic visitors gathered at the convention center to attend the famous annual automobile show.","t":"數千名熱情的參觀者聚集在會議中心參加著名的年度汽車展。"},{"w":"award","p":"n.","d":"a prize or symbol of honor given in recognition of an achievement","c":"獎項；獎品（可數）","s":"The talented young director proudly won a prestigious award for his inspirational documentary film at the festival.","t":"這位才華洋溢的年輕導演在影展上以其鼓舞人心的紀錄片自豪地贏得了一項享譽盛名的大獎。"},{"w":"award","p":"v.","d":"to officially give or grant a prize, honor, or money to someone","c":"授予；頒發；判給（動詞）","s":"The university committee decided to award a generous sports scholarship to the hardworking high school athlete.","t":"大學委員會決定頒發一筆優渥的體育獎學金給那位辛勤的高中運動員。"},{"w":"benefit","p":"n.","d":"an advantage or profit gained from something; welfare payments","c":"好處；益處；福利（可數/不可數）","s":"Although the entry-level salary is average, the company offers excellent benefits such as paid medical insurance.","t":"雖然初階薪資一般，但公司提供非常優渥的員工福利，例如全額給付的醫療保險。"},{"w":"benefit","p":"v.","d":"to receive an advantage; to be helpful or useful to someone","c":"有益於；受惠（動詞）","s":"All the elderly residents in our quiet neighborhood will greatly benefit from the newly built community clinic.","t":"我們寧靜社區裡的所有年長居民都將大大受惠於新建的社區診所。"},{"w":"beneficial","p":"adj.","d":"producing good or helpful results or effects; advantageous","c":"有益的；有幫助的","s":"Scientific research shows that regular aerobic exercise is extremely beneficial to both your heart and mental health.","t":"科學研究顯示，規律的有氧運動對心臟和心理健康都極為有益。"},{"w":"bind","p":"v.","d":"to tie or fasten tightly; to hold by legal or moral duty","c":"捆綁；包紮；裝訂；使受束縛","s":"The business partners signed a legal document that will legally bind them to work together for five years.","t":"合夥人簽署了一份法律文件，該文件將在法律上約束他們共同合作五年。"},{"w":"budget","p":"n.","d":"an estimate of income and expenditure for a set period of time","c":"預算；經費（可數）","s":"Because she is living in an expensive city as a college student, Kelly has to live on a very tight budget.","t":"身為一個生活在昂貴城市裡的大學生，凱莉必須靠非常拮据的預算過活。"},{"w":"budget","p":"v.","d":"to plan and allocate money or time carefully","c":"規劃預算；編列預算（動詞）","s":"Young married couples should learn how to budget their monthly income wisely to save enough money for their dream home.","t":"年輕的已婚夫婦應該學會如何明智地規劃…的預算每月收入，以便為他們的夢想家園存足夠的錢。"},{"w":"champion","p":"n.","d":"a person or team that has defeated all rivals in a competition","c":"冠軍；優勝者；捍衛者（可數）","s":"The heavy boxer trained intensively for six months and finally became the new world heavyweight champion.","t":"這位重量級拳擊手經過六個月的密集訓練，終於成為了新的世界重量級冠軍。"},{"w":"championship","p":"n.","d":"a competition to decide the champion; the position of champion","c":"冠軍賽；錦標賽；冠軍頭銜（可數/不可數）","s":"Our high school basketball team practiced day and night to compete in the final state championship tournament.","t":"我們高中籃球隊日夜練習，以參加最後的州錦標賽巡迴賽。"},{"w":"drain","p":"v.","d":"to cause liquid to run out; to exhaust energy or money","c":"排出液體；流乾；消耗耗盡（動詞）","s":"After finishing her warm relaxing bath, Emily pulled out the rubber plug and watched the water drain away quickly.","t":"泡完溫暖放鬆的熱水澡後，艾蜜莉拔起橡膠塞，看著水迅速流掉。"},{"w":"drain","p":"n.","d":"a pipe or hole through which liquid runs away; a drain on resources","c":"排水管；排水孔；消耗負擔（可數）","s":"The plumber used a long flexible tool to clear all the hair that had clogged the bathroom drain.","t":"水管工使用一種長而有彈性的工具清除了堵塞浴室排水孔的所有毛髮。"}]},{"unit":2,"theme":"drunk – oral","cards":[{"w":"drunk","p":"adj.","d":"affected by alcohol to the extent of losing control of one's faculties","c":"喝醉的；醉醺醺的","s":"The reckless driver was immediately arrested by the police officer for dangerous drunk driving on the highway.","t":"那名魯莽的駕駛因在公路上危險酒後駕車而被警察立即逮捕。"},{"w":"drunk","p":"n.","d":"a person who is drunk or who habitually drinks to excess","c":"酒鬼；酗酒者（可數）","s":"The noisy drunk was shouting loudly on the subway platform until security guards escorted him out.","t":"那個喧鬧的酒鬼在捷運月台上大聲喊叫，直到警衛將他護送出去。"},{"w":"flesh","p":"n.","d":"the soft substance between skin and bones in animal or human bodies; fruit pulp","c":"肉體；果肉；血肉（不可數）","s":"Thousands of excited fans screamed loudly when their favorite pop singer appeared before them in the flesh.","t":"當最喜愛的流行歌手本人親自實體出現在眼前時，數千名興奮的粉絲放聲尖叫。"},{"w":"harbor","p":"n.","d":"a sheltered port where ships, boats, and barges can dock safely","c":"港灣；海港（可數）","s":"Dozens of colorful fishing boats returned to the calm harbor to take shelter before the typhoon arrived.","t":"數十艘五彩斑斕的漁船在颱風來臨前返回平靜的海港避難。"},{"w":"harbor","p":"v.","d":"to give shelter or refuge to; to hold a thought or feeling in mind","c":"庇護；窩藏；懷有（感情、怨恨等）（動詞）","s":"You should forgive your coworkers and not harbor bitter resentment over minor misunderstandings.","t":"你應該原諒你的同事，不要因為小誤會而懷有強烈的怨恨。"},{"w":"luggage","p":"n.","d":"suitcases or other bags in which to pack personal belongings for traveling","c":"行李（不可數）","s":"Passengers are politely reminded to attach a clearly written name tag to each piece of their luggage.","t":"旅客被禮貌地提醒在每件行李上附上書寫清楚的姓名吊牌。"},{"w":"moth","p":"n.","d":"a nocturnal insect related to butterflies, typically having stout bodies and drab wings","c":"蛾；飛蛾（可數）","s":"During warm summer evenings, a pale brown moth kept fluttering endlessly around the porch lantern.","t":"在溫暖的夏夜裡，一隻淡褐色的飛蛾不停地在門廊燈籠周圍撲翅盤旋。"},{"w":"mushroom","p":"n.","d":"a fungal growth that typically takes the form of a domed cap on a stalk","c":"蘑菇；蕈類（可數）","s":"You should never pick and eat mushrooms in the wild unless an experienced expert has inspected them carefully.","t":"你絕不能採食野外的蘑菇，除非有經驗豐富的專家仔細檢查過。"},{"w":"mushroom","p":"v.","d":"to increase, spread, or develop rapidly and suddenly","c":"迅速增加；如雨後春筍般迅速發展（動詞）","s":"Trendy boutique cafes have rapidly mushroomed across every quiet street corner of the growing city.","t":"時髦的精品咖啡館在這座成長中的城市每個安靜街角如雨後春筍般迅速湧現。"},{"w":"mystery","p":"n.","d":"something that is difficult or impossible to understand or explain; a detective story","c":"神秘的事物；謎團；推理小說（可數/不可數）","s":"The disappearance of the ancient sunken ship in the deep ocean remains an unsolved mystery to this day.","t":"古老沉船在深海中的消失至今依然是一個未解的謎團。"},{"w":"mysterious","p":"adj.","d":"difficult or impossible to understand, explain, or identify; full of mystery","c":"神秘的；不可思議的","s":"The ancient temple hidden deep inside the misty jungle is surrounded by many mysterious local legends.","t":"隱藏在多霧叢林深處的古老寺廟被許多神秘的當地傳說所環繞。"},{"w":"napkin","p":"n.","d":"a square piece of cloth or paper used at a meal to wipe the fingers or lips","c":"餐巾；紙巾（可數）","s":"The polite diner neatly placed his cloth napkin on his lap before beginning the delicious multi-course meal.","t":"有禮貌的用餐者在享用多道美味佳餚之前，將布餐巾整齊地放在大腿上。"},{"w":"oral","p":"adj.","d":"spoken rather than written; relating to the mouth","c":"口頭的；口述的；口腔的","s":"All the foreign language students were nervous because they had an important oral exam on Wednesday morning.","t":"所有的外語學生都很緊張，因為他們在星期三早晨有一場重要的口試。"}]},{"unit":3,"theme":"organic – slope","cards":[{"w":"organic","p":"adj.","d":"produced or involving production without the use of chemical fertilizers or pesticides","c":"有機的；器官的；生物的","s":"Many health-conscious parents prefer to buy fresh organic vegetables for their growing children.","t":"許多注重健康的父母偏好為他們成長中的孩子購買新鮮的有機蔬菜。"},{"w":"patience","p":"n.","d":"the capacity to accept or tolerate delay, trouble, or suffering without getting angry","c":"耐心；忍耐力（不可數）","s":"After waiting in the endless airport security line for over two hours, the tired traveler began to lose his patience.","t":"在無止境的機場安檢隊伍中等待了兩個多小時後，疲憊的旅客開始失去耐心。"},{"w":"patient","p":"adj.","d":"able to accept or tolerate delays, problems, or suffering without becoming annoyed","c":"有耐心的；容忍的","s":"Our high school mathematics teacher is remarkably patient with students who struggle to understand difficult equations.","t":"我們的高中數學老師對那些難以理解複雜方程式的學生表現得極為有耐心。"},{"w":"punch","p":"v.","d":"to strike with the fist; to pierce a hole in something","c":"用拳猛擊；打孔；按鍵（動詞）","s":"The angry man lost control and punched his opponent during the heated street argument.","t":"那個憤怒的男子在激烈的街頭爭吵中失控並揮拳重擊了他的對手。"},{"w":"punch","p":"n.","d":"a blow with the fist; a drink made with fruit juice and soda; a tool for making holes","c":"重拳；水果賓治雞尾酒；打孔器（可數/不可數）","s":"The boxer knocked his opponent flat onto the canvas with just one swift, powerful punch.","t":"那名拳擊手僅憑一記迅猛有力的重拳就將對手擊倒在擂台上。"},{"w":"rocket","p":"n.","d":"a cylindrical projectile that can be propelled to a great height or through space","c":"火箭；煙火（可數）","s":"The advanced unmanned rocket carrying satellite equipment successfully launched and entered orbit around the Earth.","t":"攜帶衛星設備的先進無人火箭成功升空並進入環繞地球的軌道。"},{"w":"rocket","p":"v.","d":"to move or progress with great speed, or increase rapidly","c":"飛速上升；急升；暴漲（動詞）","s":"After starring in the blockbuster superhero movie, the young actress instantly rocketed to international fame and stardom.","t":"在主演了這部超級英雄大片後，那位年輕女演員立刻一夕爆紅／飛速成名。"},{"w":"shovel","p":"n.","d":"a tool with a broad flat blade and a handle, used for moving coal, earth, or snow","c":"鐵鍬；鏟子（可數）","s":"Every winter morning after a blizzard, my father takes a heavy metal shovel outside to clear our long driveway.","t":"每逢暴風雪過後的冬日清晨，我父親都會拿著一把沉重的金屬鏟子到外面清理我們長長的車道。"},{"w":"shovel","p":"v.","d":"to move, dig, or clear with or as if with a shovel","c":"用鏟子剷；剷除（動詞）","s":"The hardworking neighbors banded together to shovel thick snow off the front walkways for the elderly residents.","t":"辛勤的鄰居們團結在一起，為年長居民剷除前人行道上的厚雪。"},{"w":"similarity","p":"n.","d":"the state or fact of being similar; a feature that is like another","c":"相似之處；類似性（可數/不可數）","s":"Although the two twin brothers have different hobbies, their facial expressions bear a striking similarity to each other.","t":"雖然這對雙胞胎兄弟有著不同的愛好，但他們的面部表情彼此有著驚人的相似之處。"},{"w":"skillful","p":"adj.","d":"having or showing skill, proficiency, or expert technique","c":"熟練的；技術高超的","s":"The delicate brain operation was successfully completed by a team of highly skillful surgical specialists.","t":"這場精細的腦部手術是由一群技術精湛的外科專家團隊順利完成的。"},{"w":"sleeve","p":"n.","d":"the part of a garment that wholly or partly covers a person's arm","c":"袖子；套筒（可數）","s":"Before helping his father wash the muddy family car, Tommy carefully rolled up his shirt sleeves.","t":"在幫父親清洗泥濘的家庭汽車前，湯米仔細地捲起了襯衫袖子。"},{"w":"slope","p":"n.","d":"a surface of which one end or side is at a higher level than another; an incline","c":"斜坡；坡道；傾斜度（可數）","s":"Hundreds of excited winter sports fans traveled to the Swiss resort to hit the snowy slopes this weekend.","t":"數百名興奮的冬季運動愛好者本週末前往瑞士度假村去滑雪道滑雪。"}]},{"unit":4,"theme":"spill – vivid","cards":[{"w":"spill","p":"v.","d":"to cause or allow liquid to run over the edge of a container","c":"溢出；灑出；洩漏（動詞）","s":"Please keep this secret safe and make sure you do not spill the beans about Kevin's surprise party.","t":"請保守這個秘密，切記絕對不要洩漏秘密關於凱文的驚喜派對。"},{"w":"spill","p":"n.","d":"an act of spilling or an amount of liquid spilled","c":"溢出物；洩漏（可數）","s":"Volunteers worked tirelessly along the coastline to rescue seabirds injured by the devastating industrial oil spill.","t":"志工們沿著海岸線不懈努力，拯救因災難性工業漏油事件而受傷的海鳥。"},{"w":"spinach","p":"n.","d":"an edible flowering plant with large, dark green leaves, eaten as a vegetable","c":"菠菜（不可數）","s":"Mom gently steamed a large bowl of fresh baby spinach with a drizzle of virgin olive oil for dinner.","t":"媽媽蒸了一大碗新鮮的嫩菠菜，淋上一點初榨橄欖油作為晚餐。"},{"w":"sword","p":"n.","d":"a weapon with a long metal blade, sharp point and edge, and a handle","c":"劍；刀劍（可數）","s":"The brave medieval knight drew his sharp steel sword to defend the castle against the enemy soldiers.","t":"勇敢的中世紀騎士拔出他鋒利的鋼劍，保衛城堡免受敵兵侵害。"},{"w":"tailor","p":"n.","d":"a person whose occupation is making, fitting, or altering garments","c":"裁縫師（可數）","s":"Because he lost fifteen pounds, Mr. Davis took his expensive business suits to a skilled local tailor for adjustments.","t":"因為體重減輕了十五磅，戴維斯先生把昂貴的西裝送到當地一位手藝精湛的裁縫師那裡進行修改。"},{"w":"tailor","p":"v.","d":"to make, adapt, or customize for a particular purpose or person","c":"量身定制；調整使適應（動詞）","s":"The software company designed a specialized program that is specifically tailored for small healthcare clinics.","t":"這家軟體公司設計了一個專為小型醫療診所量身定制的專業軟體。"},{"w":"theory","p":"n.","d":"a supposition or a system of ideas intended to explain something","c":"學說；理論；推測（可數/不可數）","s":"In theory, the new public transport system sounds perfect, but in reality, severe traffic jams still occur daily.","t":"在理論上，這套新的大眾運輸系統聽起來很完美，但實際上每天依然發生嚴重的交通堵塞。"},{"w":"thread","p":"n.","d":"a long, thin strand of cotton, silk, or other fibers used in sewing","c":"線；細絲；脈絡（可數/不可數）","s":"The elderly grandmother asked her granddaughter to help her pass the thin silk thread through the tiny eye of the needle.","t":"年邁的祖母請孫女幫忙將細絲線穿過細小的針眼。"},{"w":"thread","p":"v.","d":"to pass a thread through the eye of a needle; to weave through","c":"穿線；穿過（動詞）","s":"My hands were trembling so nervously that I could hardly thread the needle to repair my ripped jacket button.","t":"我的雙手緊張得不停顫抖，以致於幾乎無法穿針引線來修補脫落的外套鈕扣。"},{"w":"trunk","p":"n.","d":"the main stem of a tree; a car's luggage compartment; an elephant's long nose; swimming trunks","c":"樹幹；汽車行李箱；象鼻；游泳褲（可數）","s":"We placed three large travel suitcases inside the car's trunk before driving toward the airport terminal.","t":"在開車前往機場航廈之前，我們把三個大旅行箱放進了汽車後車廂裡。"},{"w":"tutor","p":"n.","d":"a private teacher, typically one who teaches a single student or a very small group","c":"家庭教師；導師（可數）","s":"Because Jason was struggling with calculus, his supportive parents decided to hire a knowledgeable math tutor for him.","t":"因為傑森在微積分方面遇到困難，他給予支持的父母決定為他聘請一位知識淵博的數學家教。"},{"w":"tutor","p":"v.","d":"to act as a private teacher to someone; to instruct individually","c":"指導；輔導；個別授課（動詞）","s":"During her university summer vacation, Rachel earned extra pocket money by tutoring junior high school students in chemistry.","t":"在大學暑假期間，瑞秋透過在化學方面個別輔導國中生來賺取額外的零用錢。"},{"w":"vivid","p":"adj.","d":"producing powerful feelings or strong, clear images in the mind; bright and deep in color","c":"生動的；逼真的；鮮明耀眼的","s":"Even after forty years, Grandpa still retains a remarkably vivid memory of his wedding day in Paris.","t":"即使四十年過去了，爺爺對在巴黎的結婚那天依然保留著極為鮮明清晰的記憶。"}]},{"unit":5,"theme":"voter – zip","cards":[{"w":"voter","p":"n.","d":"a person who has the legal right to vote or who votes in an election","c":"選民；投票人（可數）","s":"The progressive presidential candidate held several public rallies to appeal to first-time young voters.","t":"這位進步派總統候選人舉行了數場公開造勢集會，以爭取首次投票的年輕選民。"},{"w":"vote","p":"v.","d":"to give a vote; to express one's choice or opinion in an election","c":"投票；表決（動詞）","s":"Every adult citizen living in a democratic society has the constitutional right to vote for government leaders.","t":"生活在民主社會中的每一位成年公民都擁有投票選出政府領導人的憲法權利。"},{"w":"vote","p":"n.","d":"a formal indication of a choice between two or more candidates or options","c":"選票；投票；表決權（可數/不可數）","s":"Citizens patiently stood in line for hours outside the local community school to cast their official vote.","t":"市民們耐心地在當地社區學校外排隊數小時，投下他們的正式選票。"},{"w":"weekly","p":"adj.","d":"done, produced, or occurring once a week or every week","c":"每週的；每週一次的","s":"All department managers must attend the regular weekly conference every Monday morning at nine o'clock.","t":"所有部門經理都必須在每週一上午九點參加常規的每週會議。"},{"w":"weekly","p":"adv.","d":"once a week; by the week","c":"每週地；每星期一次地","s":"Part-time student workers at the university bookstore are very pleased to receive their paychecks weekly.","t":"在大學書店打工的工讀生很高興能夠按週領取他們的薪水。"},{"w":"monthly","p":"adj./adv.","d":"done, produced, occurring, or payable once every month","c":"每月的；按月地；每月一次的","s":"Tenants living in the downtown apartment building are required to pay their fixed monthly rent on the first day of each month.","t":"住在市中心公寓的房客必須在每個月的第一天繳納固定的每月房租。"},{"w":"yearly","p":"adj./adv.","d":"happening, done, or produced once a year or every year; annual","c":"每年的；按年地；一年一度的","s":"The board of directors held their yearly shareholder meeting to review the company's financial performance.","t":"董事會舉行了一年一度的股東大會，審查公司的財務績效。"},{"w":"widen","p":"v.","d":"to make or become wider; to expand or broaden","c":"變寬；加寬；擴大；拓寬（動詞）","s":"The municipal city council decided to widen the narrow main road to reduce morning traffic congestion.","t":"市議會決定拓寬狹窄的幹道，以減緩早晨的交通擁塞。"},{"w":"zipper","p":"n.","d":"a device consisting of two flexible strips of metal or plastic with interlocking projections","c":"拉鍊（可數）","s":"The sturdy metal zipper on my winter parka got stuck because a loose thread was caught inside it.","t":"我的冬季厚大衣上結實的金屬拉鍊卡住了，因為有一條鬆脫的線頭被夾在裡面。"},{"w":"zip","p":"v.","d":"to fasten or unfasten with a zipper; to move at high speed","c":"拉上拉鍊；飛速疾行（動詞）","s":"It was so freezing cold and windy outside that the mother told her little boy to zip up his jacket tightly.","t":"外面寒冷又颳風，母親叫她的小男孩把夾克拉鍊緊緊拉上。"}]}];
